        "parameters": {
          "width": 560,
          "height": 1320,
          "content": "## One Idea → Native Visuals in Every Language (Canvora Multilingual Fan-Out)\n\n### How it works\n\nSubmit content once through the built-in form; Canvora designs the visual, then *localizes* it into each language you listed — same design, natively generated text (not machine-translated overlays). The workflow generates the original, fans out one item per language, calls Canvora's localization API for each, polls until each version completes, and posts every language version to Slack as it finishes, ending with a completion summary.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Create a free Canvora account at [canvora.ai](https://canvora.ai) — free credits included, no card required — and get an API key from canvora.ai → Integrations → API Keys (available on all plans).\n- In every Canvora HTTP Request node, use one shared Header Auth credential: name `X-API-Key`, value your `vd_...` key.\n- Localization uses Canvora's Visual Editor feature (Starter plan or an active Campaign Pack) — a 403 on the localize call means the plan lacks the feature, not an auth error.\n- Connect Slack credentials and pick your channel.\n- Open the form URL from the trigger node to submit your first idea.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change `instagram_post` in the Post Idea to Canvora API node to any of 100+ formats (GET https://api.canvora.ai/api/formats).\n- Languages field accepts codes (`es, de`) or names (`Spanish, German`) — 150+ supported.\n- Cost: 10 credits for the original + 10 per localized visual (e.g. es + de + fr = 40 total)."
        },
        "typeVersion": 1
      },
